[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3758334000","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115020#issuecomment-3758334000","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115020","id":3758334000,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gA6Aw","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-16T06:07:55Z","updated_at":"2026-01-16T06:07:55Z","body":"@Clubhouse1661 that technically works, but it does add some overhead as we're adding checking and a branch. We were discussing on the rendering channel to do make the `USE_MULTIVIEW` define accessible in the shader so the right code gets compiled in.\r\n\r\nThen you could just do an `#ifdef USE_MULTIVIEW` block.\r\n\r\nIt looks like `insert_builtin_define` tells the shader compiler about the existence of the define, but it also adds it in, so there might be a little more to it.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3758334000/reactions","total_count